WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
If your Turo account got suspended
tomorrow, how much of your business would

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:04.400
disappear with

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:11.000
it? Not would it hurt? How much would be
gone? The bookings, the reviews, you spent

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:11.740
two years

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:17.000
building the customers who rented from you
five times, all lived on someone else's

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.220
platform,

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:25.020
and they can shut the door whenever they
want. Now, I'm not saying quit the

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:25.720
marketplaces,

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:31.060
quit your Turo account, they bring demand
and the demand is good, but I want to show

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:31.220
you

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:34.580
something most operators don't realise
until it's too late.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:41.870
Because let's do the maths. Say you're
running 8, 10, 12 vehicles on a

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:43.230
marketplace. You're

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:46.590
handing over nearly 40 -50 % of every
single booking.

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:48.810
Run that over a year, that's not

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:53.010
a fee, as a partner you never actually
agreed to take on, who does none of the

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:53.650
work and

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:59.390
takes a cut of everything. And it's not
just the money, three things are quietly

00:00:59.390 --> 00:00:59.870
working

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:00.510
against you.

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:05.790
1. You don't own the customers. Every
booking goes through them.

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:07.090
The renter belongs to the

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:12.370
platform, not you. And you can't follow
up, you can't build loyalty, you can't

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:12.550
bring

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:18.720
them back on your own terms. 2. You pay
for every booking forever.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.200
There's no volume,

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:26.000
there's no discount on graduation. The
bigger you get, the more you hand over,

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:26.420
you're

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:30.980
being punished for growing. 3. Your brand
stays invisible.

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:33.100
Renters remember the marketplace,

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:39.040
not you. You're building someone else's
reputation with your cars, your service

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:39.800
and your risk.

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:46.530
So here's the shift. The operators who win
long term don't just pick marketplaces or

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:50.730
they don't just pick direct. They run
both. But they build a direct channel they

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:51.070
actually

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:54.810
own, running right alongside the
marketplace traffic they already have.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:55.910
Their own booking

00:01:55.910 --> 00:02:02.000
sites, their own domain, their own brand.
Customers book directly and they keep 100

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:02.240
%

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:06.560
of them and every one of those bookings
has zero commission attached.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:13.250
One operator who I'll show you, Douglas,
he went from 12 vehicles out of Atlanta,

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:14.210
went

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:17.690
from a 100 % marketplace to 60 % direct in
4 months.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:21.310
That move alone recovered $18 ,000

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:27.350
in fees. Same cars, same demand. He just
stopped renting his own business back from

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:27.830
our platform.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:35.020
Now you're probably thinking it sounds too
good in theory, but is it real?

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.420
Is it actually

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:40.580
built or is it just sides? And I promise.
I mean, very fair question.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:41.800
So the next video

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:45.000
I'm going to show you, I'm not just going
to pitch, I'm going to actually open up

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:45.100
the

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:49.920
actual system and walk you through the
real screens, booking sites, your

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:50.700
customers see

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:55.730
and the dashboard you'd run everything
from. No animation, the real thing.
